=== S16: 无法在 v2 中构造的场景如实标注 ===
    pin dirs at scenario start: 0
    PMU refusal: v2 has no PMU consumer (scripts/doctor.py reports pmu_read_test NOT_RUN),
      so there is no code path that could refuse it -- UNSUPPORTED, not a pass.
    heartbeat stop: heartbeat_ns is only consulted in adaptive mode, which v2 refuses at
      apply (S03), and nothing in v2 ever writes it -- UNSUPPORTED by design.
    PID re-creation: a pidfd is held for the transaction, so a recycled pid cannot be
      re-interpreted under it; task death is covered here and in tests/integration_fd.sh.
    TID targets: v2 binds tgids only (class_map is keyed by tgid) -- out of scope for P1.
S16	PASS	无法在 v2 中构造的场景如实标注	assertions held, sched_ext disabled, no pins added by this scenario

